rocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease.\"\n1874:        \"contract\": \"Mandatory clean-room GroupB oracle: empty temporary HOME with no ~/.opencode/bin/opencode; monkeypatch.setattr(server, \\\"OPENCODE_BIN\\\", str(fake_serve_bin)); actual parent -> helper_proc -> fake_serve_bin, not in-process mock. Parent uses subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); helper uses subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). Prove child executable and all serve arguments exactly equal passed fake, same owned child_pgid, zero OPENCODE_BIN in serve_env, no broader whitelist. Spy/audit helper I/O plus early-exit structural assertions prove zero state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json accesses and no sqlite3/http.client/http.server/zen_catalog loaded; reload_catalog/_DEFAULT_RESILIENCE and server globals absent. Reject every invalid six-argument length/value before spawn. Retain EOF/TERM/lease/reaper/listener proof fault oracles: this test does not replace them. Actual Stage3 test NOT_RUN; EVD-079 local minimal chain observed.\",\n1885:      \"choice\": \"Option C/A1: один ephemeral serve v2.1.2 на попытку; canonical source для SSE/JSON. В auto run fallback только до HTTP-заголовков ответа POST /prompt И до первого валидного события исполнения текущей сессии; после барьера никакого silent run fallback.\",\n1890:        \"OPENCODE_DB=:memory: selected (EVD-071120.7ms/156.8MiB/0.db), preserves standard read-only auth.json; empty XDG_DATA_HOME137.9ms/203.5MiB breaks opencode-go auth unless explicitly passed read-only. Shared DB + _StartupGate rejected: shared mutation/locks violate frozen scope; no automatic fallback to that option.\",\n1891:        \"--port 0 + stdout port announcement considered: child picks own port but stable versioned stdout announcement not evidenced; would require new bounded parser/ownership proof. Choose parent-reserved ephemeral port + one lsof + persistent lanes; port race remains fail-closed with cap3.\",\n1893:        \"opencode serve --stdio ([F-30], EVD-078): help confirms flag; observed as internal child IPC of opencode run, but no public external framing/message contract or OpenAPI v2.1.2 mapping is evidenced for it. Treat as undocumented internal CLI IPC, not a verified external SSE API; accepting it would require new framing/flow-control/permission/ownership evidence and parser, not scope justified by this delta. Keep selected Option C/A1 HTTP+SSE: actual reasoning/text deltas and HTTP lifecycle verified [F-17]..[F-22], schemas frozen EVD-062/073. No assertion that merely --stdio is broken; flag availability alone is insufficient.\"\n1909:        \"Кодовый дефолт REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED=false. Локальный runtime dynamic_config.json — stdlib-аналог dynamic_config.py/GigaRC автономного моста без внешних зависимостей: H0 отсутствие файла или boolean false удерживает run; H7 атомарно включает true только после успешных H3 (6 параллельных слотов RSS/FD с OPENCODE_DB=\\\":memory:\\\") и H6 (живая permission/tool изоляция на кандидате). Без исключений из канона или human waiver; без новых env-переменных для самого фичефлага REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED через dynamic_config.json и без правок start.sh/LaunchAgent; никакой записи dynamic_config.json в git. Новые диагностические/override env-переменные этого пакета: OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_TRANSPORT, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_PERMISSION_POLICY, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_DISABLE_FILE и watchdog overrides OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_FIRST_EVENT_TIMEOUT_S, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_FIRST_TOKEN_TIMEOUT_S, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_STALL_TIMEOUT_S (AD-003). Сам рабочий фичефлаг REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED переключается boolean в dynamic_config.json без новой env для переключения и без правки start.sh/LaunchAgent; кодовый default=false, включение H7 только после H3/H6.\"\n1976:          \"feature_flag_context\": \"Кодовый дефолт REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED=false. Локальный runtime dynamic_config.json — stdlib-аналог dynamic_config.py/GigaRC автономного моста без внешних зависимостей: H0 отсутствие файла или boolean false удерживает run; H7 атомарно включает true только после успешных H3 (6 параллельных слотов RSS/FD с OPENCODE_DB=\\\":memory:\\\") и H6 (живая permission/tool изоляция на кандидате). Без исключений из канона или human waiver; без новых env-переменных для самого фичефлага REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED через dynamic_config.json и без правок start.sh/LaunchAgent; никакой записи dynamic_config.json в git. Новые диагностические/override env-переменные этого пакета: OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_TRANSPORT, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_PERMISSION_POLICY, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_DISABLE_FILE и watchdog overrides OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_FIRST_EVENT_TIMEOUT_S, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_FIRST_TOKEN_TIMEOUT_S, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_STALL_TIMEOUT_S (AD-003). Сам рабочий фичефлаг REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED переключается boolean в dynamic_config.json без новой env для переключения и без правки start.sh/LaunchAgent; кодовый default=false, включение H7 только после H3/H6.\",\n1978:            \"value\": \"Path(__file__).resolve().parent / \\\"dynamic_config.json\\\"\",\n1982:            \"reload\": \"На каждый новый запрос os.stat O(1), кэш по (st_mtime_ns, st_size), с учётом identity DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH для изолированных тестов. При неизменной паре без переоткрытия/JSON parsing; смена пары перечитывает bounded локальный JSON и публикует boolean snapshot под lock. Удаление, ошибка stat/read, битый JSON, неверный root или небулево значение ->false немедленно, без stale true. Ошибки чтения/валидации дают diagnostic warning без содержимого файла/секретов; повторяющийся warning ограничен, чтение ошибки можно повторить на следующем запросе. Не нужен restart Server/LaunchAgent.\",\n1983:            \"write\": \"Только rollout operator: tempfile в том же каталоге, mode0600, JSON boolean, os.replace атомарно; только после H3/H6 на H7. Локальный production файл ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/dynamic_config.json вне git; Architect его не создаёт.\"\n1986:        \"auto_fake_compatibility\": \"В git-клоне bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/dynamic_config.json отсутствует и не коммитится; default=false гарантирует прежний run для всех378 fake-CLI baseline tests REQ-003/AC-004, без опоры на shebang/имя теста/FAKE_OC_MODE. При explicit enabled auto дополнительно cached executable path+mtime_ns+size/first bytes: shebang/text ->run без --help/--version/serve subprocess; native opencode ->serve. Явный test-only eligibility override допустим только fixtures; force serve для FakeServe сохраняет первый kill-switch приоритет и stdin=DEVNULL. Explicit env false/run ->zero serve UUID/password/queue/threads/probes/Popen до file stat; default=false selector допускает только O(1) config stat, без serve allocations. При смене executable cache key старые capability/health инвалидируются.\",\n1987:        \"spawn\": \"One tree only: server.py parent -> helper_proc -> serve_proc; no direct parent Popen(opencode serve). Each attempt spends one common _RequestAttempts token and spawn-rate admission (cap3), paired helper is bounded auxiliary, not a free model attempt. Unified limiter+startup gate deadline<=5.0s; fresh _serve_env(model_id) calls immutable _run_env once and rotates proxy once. Parent reserves127.0.0.1:0 until just before helper spawn; creates lifeline_r,lifeline_w=os.pipe(), close_fds=True. helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid and os.getpgid(helper_proc.pid)==child_pgid. Parent closes lifeline_r after Popen even on exceptions; lifeline_w never inherited by helper/serve and is closed in parent finally. Helper installs TERM handler and arms EOF monitoring on stdin fd0 BEFORE serve Popen; already-latched EOF causes cleanup without spawn. Helper immediately atomically creates /tmp/opencode-zen-bridge-leases/lease-<attempt_id>.json with helper_pid,helper_lstart,pgid=child_pgid,port,start_ts,parent identity,temp ownership. It launches serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). Thus os.getpgid(serve_proc.pid)==child_pgid: helper and serve+descendants share ONE group. Helper atomically/fsync publishes serve_pid and serve_lstart in lease BEFORE stdout handshake JSON {\\\"serve_pid\\\":...,\\\"pgid\\\":...}, before lsof/READY/Auth/prompt. Parent gets exact serve_pid/child_pgid from handshake; port-only identity never sufficient. EOF immediately after either Popen is latched throughout publish/handshake; bounded EOF loop<=0.25s runs before readiness and during prompt. Standard XDG_DATA_HOME/auth preserved, OPENCODE_DB=\\\":memory:\\\" on all3 env branches; sanitized serve_env, no prompt/password in argv/stdin/lease. Port race consumes common token and retries only after full cleanup within original ready<=3s; all lsof/identity probes included. Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease.\",\n1988:        \"startup\": \"SERVE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=3.0s (ready_budget_s=3.0): после owner proof лёгкий authenticated GET /api/session/active, HTTP200 + $.data object map of active sessions (empty={}); не качать 281KB /openapi.json на каждом spawn. Control I/O slices<=.25s, всего<=3 readiness TCP probes, remaining request deadline/cancel всегда проверяются. Child EOF/no listener/incompatible protocol -> ServeUnavailable. Пароль secrets per spawn в OPENCODE_SERVER_PASSWORD ПОСЛЕ whitelist, Basic opencode:<password>, никогда в argv/URL/log. stdout/stderr bounded drain+redact. HTTP на loopback напрямую без proxy/redirects. Readiness не устанавливает first_event_ms и не сбрасывает first_event/token часы.\",\n1989:        \"fallback_barrier\": \"State machine: ADMISSION -> SPAWN/OWNER/READY -> CREATE/SUBSCRIBE -> PROMPT_SENDING -> DELIVERED -> TERMINAL -> CLEANUP. Auto ServeUnavailable на старте/create/subscribe или до получения HTTP response headers POST /api/session/{id}/prompt допускает один budgeted run fallback, ТОЛЬКО если не было валидного события исполнения созданной session после начала отправки prompt, нет model/tool output, auth/security failure, cancel или deadline. Перед run полностью close/join/killpg/reap старую attempt, удалить temp data; новый Popen требует тот же retry token/Full Jitter/attempt ceiling<=3. С первого response header POST /prompt (любой status) ИЛИ первого session execution event после prompt delivery лачится DELIVERED=true; silent fallback и переключение на run для текущего запроса запрещены, включая отсутствие response body и headers-pending+SSE-started. Prompt POST исполняется daemon worker параллельно SSE; до header/события ожидание ограничено остатком first_event20s/first_token60s и total deadline. Даже до headers неизвестная доставка может дать повторную генерацию: допустимость этой границы явно задана текущим brief RW-001, это НЕ exactly-once; старый PGID должен быть убран до fallback, built-ins никогда allow. После barrier watchdog может выполнить только явный общий retry того же транспорта с retry-status/cleanup/cap, не скрытый run fallback. HTTP401/403/auth/permission/capability-security denial -> fail-closed без fallback/auto policy switching на любой фазе. Authoritative phase/event/counter table: fallback_decision_table. first_event20 preheader/noevent ->budgeted fallback_to_run; after anyheader ->explicit serve_retry. Error headers latch barrier before HTTP classification.\",\n1990:        \"session_flow\": \"После listener proof/readiness и подтверждения safe permission capability POST /api/session по session_wire.create; затем GET /api/event с HTTP200 text/event-stream и reader armed ДО отправки первого байта тела prompt. На create + subscribe один SERVE_SESSION_SETUP_TIMEOUT_S=2.0s, не включая model generation или ожидание POST /prompt response. Передать полный prompt в JSON body через единственный daemon delivery worker, одновременно читать SSE в owned reader; supervisor/SSE writer не ждут блокирующий POST и остаются cancel-aware. Один POST /prompt с delivery=steer,resume=true; transport HTTP headers/ошибки передаются supervisor как control events. First-event/token часы якорятся на prompt_send_start, не на HTTP ready/создание сессии. Filter data.sessionID==created_sid; реальные v2 события не содержат executionID, поэтому использовать own per-attempt session + prompt-send generation latch, event id дедуп и assistantMessageID step key, не выдумывать executionID. server.connected/session.created/global updates/pre-prompt events не считаются first execution. Terminal success/failed независим от text end; EOF без terminal -> protocol failure. step.ended с готовым DSH tool call -> остановить дальнейшее исполнение/cleanup. Include nested form.created.data.form.sessionID filtering before flat session filter. Mandatory reject/cancel then interrupt single_turn_control; never wait on prompt POST, never stream Step2.\",\n1991:        \"tool_policy\": \"Default OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_PERMISSION_POLICY=ask_reject: _serve_env(model_id) вызывает _run_env(model_id) ровно один раз, копирует/merge scoped OPENCODE_CONFIG_CONTENT permission={\\\"*\\\":\\\"ask\\\"} с сохранением provider/options/OPENCODE_MODELS_PATH, session permissions=[{action:\\\"*\\\",resource:\\\"*\\\",effect:\\\"ask\\\"}]. _run_env(model_id) оставить ПОБАЙТОВО неизменным, tests/test_run_env.py не менять. На wire permission.asked (логическая группа session.permission.requested) немедленно POST /api/session/{id}/permission/{data.id}/reply {decision:\\\"reject\\\"}; никогда allow/once/always. Reply через bounded control lane, не ожидает completion prompt POST, HTTP budget<=.25s и cancel/deadline; failure -> явный security error+cleanup, без деградации в разрешение. Env=deny выставляет config permission={\\\"*\\\":\\\"deny\\\"} и session effect=deny, без пересборки; если всё же пришёл ask, только reject. Неподдержанная policy/отсутствие safe permission capability -> fail-closed. Нет автоматического deny↔ask_reject switching даже до prompt: разница позиций R1 закрыта явным выбором безопасного селектора. После принятия prompt 401/403 никогда не дают run fallback. EVD-050 + F-08 объясняют Zen403 с deny; FakeServe проверяет оба режима и byte hash _run_env, реальную Zen совместимость/запрещённую запись доказывает только H6. _run_env does NOT sanitize every branch; _serve_env must apply serve_env_sanitization to all3 branches. Mandatory form.created→cancel and reject/cancel→immediate interrupt single_turn_control; JSON args fallback input.ended.data.text when called absent; no second-step output.\",\n1997:          \"session.tool.*\": \"Actual input.started(name), input.delta, input.ended(text), called(input,executed), progress(metadata), success/failed. Correlate data.sessionID+assistantMessageID+id; accumulate tool name/input, normalize tool_use part{tool,state{input,status}}+call_id. permission.asked отправляет decision=reject немедленно по отдельному control lane. Никакого встроенного allow или выполнения bridge-side. On input.ended save $.data.text and parse JSON as object with runtime validation. Prefer called.data.input if present and valid; if called absent before failed/step.ended use completed input.ended.text, including streaming→failed. Never emit partial JSON; dedup by sessionID/assistantMessageID/call id. Both paths give identical mapped DSH tool_calls. Invalid JSON follows existing incomplete/unmapped recovery, not invented empty args.\",\n1998:          \"session.step.failed / session.execution.failed\": \"$.data.error {type,message,status?,response?,retryAfterMs?} ->canonical error{statusCode,message}: statusCode=$.data.error.status если integer100..599; иначе explicit known type mapping provider.free-limit429/auth401/permission denial403, unknown null. Terminal independent, one cause not counted twice.\",\n2001:          \"payload_validation\": \"Проверять exact field paths/types и mandatory sessionID до emit. Текущая schema shape mismatch -> invalid_serve_event (не пустая полезная delta), отдельный ServeHealth; permission capability mismatch ->security fail-closed. Incremental UTF8/CRLF/multiline SSE/comments/fragment boundaries, byte budgets как прежде. Никакого Coder-discovered protocol или aliases, которых нет в frozen source. Coder и FakeServe используют frozen expected независимо; мутации delta path/token/permission должны краснить тест даже если adapter и mock согласованно ошибочны. For form.created safety action with nested own sessionID+nonempty id MUST precede other schema validation; see form.created / form.cancelled policy; never delay cancel for missing root title.\",\n2074:                \"dedup_step_key\": \"$.data.assistantMessageID\",\n2088:            \"session.permission.requested / session.tool.*\": {\n2089:              \"wire_event_name\": \"permission.asked\",\n2090:              \"logical_family\": \"session.permission.requested\",\n2094:                \"type\": \"permission.asked\",\n2118:                \"path\": \"/api/session/ses_fixture_1/permission/per_fixture_1/reply\",\n2181:                      \"type\": \"permission.rejected\",\n2190:                  \"type\": \"permission.replied\",\n2213:              \"note\": \"Family label из brief — не имя wire event. В бинарнике нет session.permission.requested или session.tool.started: actual names permission.asked и session.tool.input.started/called/progress/success/failed. Имя tool копить из input.started; canonical payload emit после complete input/called, не исполнять по частичному JSON. Lifecycle updates не создают повторный DSH tool_call; own denied event не является model progress. Указанный failed message — синтетическое fixture значение типа error, не заявление о захваченном live отказе.\"\n2241:              \"note\": \"provider.free-limit ->429; provider.auth/permission denial ->fatal401/403; неизвестный type сохраняется как явная ошибка с statusCode=null, не выдумывать retryability. step.failed + execution.failed одной cause дедуп без потери terminal. Numeric wire key status, not statusCode/data.statusCode; source Session.StructuredError. Missing numeric status allowed as in captured free-limit event.\"\n2334:        \"non_stream\": \"serve используется и stream=False через общий source; Run копит чистые model reasoning/text/native/usage как сейчас. Synthetic [мост] статусы — только SSE presentation, в JSON reasoning_content не добавляются. Google direct dispatch остаётся первым и не создаёт serve/новые timers.\",\n2338:            \"Helper publishes serve_pid/serve_lstart/pgid atomically before JSON handshake {\\\"serve_pid\\\":...,\\\"pgid\\\":...}; parent validates helper_proc.pid==child_pgid==os.getpgid(helper_proc.pid), handshake/lease match before any lsof/READY/Auth.\",\n2339:            \"SPAWN→READY: exactly1 lsof -nP -a -iTCP:<port> -sTCP:LISTEN -Fp,timeout<=0.35s. Require single listener_pid==serve_pid AND os.getpgid(listener_pid)==child_pgid AND helper_proc.poll() is None. Mismatch/ambiguous/timeout:0secret bytes,ServeHealth+1 once, cleanup own group only.\",\n2341:            \"For entire normal permission/form/reply/interrupt/DELETE path:1lsof total per successful spawn, including50 control operations; never extra lsof or reconnect in <=0.25s reply/<=0.20s final API cleanup.\",\n2342:            \"Only separate explicit control-socket reconnect may perform second lsof/proof<=0.35s, against same serve_pid/child_pgid/live helper/lease BEFORE Authorization; outside0.25s/0.20s budgets, no sent-request retry or prompt replay. Urgent pending control on broken socket fails closed immediately; SSE/prompt disconnect closes attempt.\",\n2343:            \"On helper death close all lanes/fail-closed; no Auth to replacement listener. Foreign PID/PGID never signalled. Parent cleanup closes lifeline_w then TERM→KILL child_pgid, including live descendants even if serve exited. lsof/identity probe own bounded lifecycle; cleanup never reconnects.\"\n2345:          \"owner_probe_timeout_s\": 0.35,\n2347:          \"ready_deadline_includes\": \"lsof+keepalive setup+GET active and cache-miss protocol projection all within3.0s; repeated port attempt does not reset it.\",\n2359:          \"handshake\": \"On changed executable stat key invalidate cache and revalidate owned child /api/info version+pid and bounded /openapi.json<=512KiB inside ready3s. app version2.1.2 is reference, NOT equality-only reject gate. Permit changed binary version/mtime iff canonical required-endpoints/schema/event projection hash equals validated reference projection. API info.version0.0.1 distinct. Required projection includes Model.Ref,Permission.Ruleset,PromptInput,TokenUsage/StructuredError,Form.Info/State and six fixture families + all used methods/path parameter schemas. No permission endpoint ->security fail-closed; benign other projection mismatch ->ServeUnavailable before prompt.\",\n2369:        \"admission\": \"Один monotonic pre_spawn_deadline=now+min(5.0,remaining_request) охватывает _SpawnRateLimiter и _StartupGate. Сначала получить rate token с timeout=remaining_admission; gate может ждать только остаток этого же окна и fail-open по legacy, без добавочных5s; timeout rate token -> не spawn. Hold gate<=12s не является отдельным pre-spawn wait; release при готовности собственного child/EOF/finally, HTTP ready по-прежнему не событие модели. Cancel poll<=.25s, каждый Popen включая fallback/race учитывается _RequestAttempts<=3; token не обходить.\",\n2371:          \"schema\": \"opencode serve v2.1.2, EVD-062/EVD-063; paths и JSON properties заморожены до Coder\",\n2388:              \"permissions\": [\n2398:            \"permission_variant\": \"Для policy=deny тот же ruleset с effect=deny; ask_reject effect=ask + немедленный decision=reject. В API permissions — ARRAY rules, не config object {\\\"*\\\":\\\"ask\\\"}.\",\n2408:            \"body\": \"SSE data JSON envelope {id,created,type,data}; subscribe armed до prompt body, filter data.sessionID\"\n2424:          \"permission_reply\": {\n2426:            \"path\": \"/api/session/{id}/permission/{requestID}/reply\",\n2431:            \"request_id_path\": \"$.data.id of permission.asked; session path id=$.data.sessionID\",\n2432:            \"note\": \"Wire key decision, не reply; permission.replied notification содержит reply=reject. Никогда once/always/allow.\",\n2439:            \"connection_policy\": \"Use existing proven Keep-Alive control only; no lsof/reconnect. If unavailable skip API, kill owned PGID; do not add0.35s reconnect into0.20s API budget.\",\n2444:          \"readiness\": {\n2469:            \"timeout_s\": 0.25,\n2480:            \"shared_DB_plus_StartupGate\": \"Rejected: violates no shared DB mutation/lock boundary; cannot use as fallback without owner scope approval.\"\n2488:        \"typing\": \"Decode wire JSON as object with isinstance narrowing/TypedDict; new code no Any/casts-to-Any/type-ignore. VER-004 uses isolated bridge cwd + temporary include/extraPaths: all3 errorCount==0, new test0diagnostics, server Any<=125each/nonAny per-rule and total<=720, step<=194; changed legacy code0reportAny/reportExplicitAny/reportUnusedCallResult. Preserve public module attribute server.CATALOG_SOURCE and HTTP catalog_source: module-level CATALOG_SOURCE = \\\"static\\\", never rename it or external test references. Replace reload_catalog global CATALOG_SOURCE/reassignment with typed def _set_catalog_source(source: str) -> None: globals()[\\\"CATALOG_SOURCE\\\"] = source; keep only _catalog_mtime/_catalog_ids in reload_catalog global declaration. Preserve static import zen_catalog as zc in the normal-server else branch (original import server.py:67); it remains the only permitted E402 location if a finding exists, zero E402 findings is valid; guard proc is not None before both final stream .returncode reads. EVD-076 observed errorCount0 without # type: ignore; tests/test_catalog_mode.py:64,93 unchanged,8tests PASS on copy. coder_target_files remains exactly3; no config/dependency/new module. Full all3 Stage3 gate NOT_RUN. Ruff==0.17.2 legacy ranges use only --range={start}:1-{end}:999; reject any old/new diff hunk intersecting _run_env/_stream_google_sse/_execute_google_once and check their literal raw hashes before and after formatter. Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease. EVD-076 static-import server warningCount564/reportAny125, EVD-077 full local block exit0 with catalog8/8; source init→static transition is probe-only. Actual Stage3 NOT_RUN. Write-mode range formatting must run on disposable candidate copy and assert_frozen(copy), never write product during architecture probe.\",\n2495:            \"first_event_timeout на serve после prompt и HTTP readiness, без валидных событий исполнения\",\n2497:            \"serve SSE EOF без terminal; first_token_timeout только при доказанной protocol/capability причине, иначе model failure\",\n2498:            \"listener_ownership failure/ambiguous PID/PGID mismatch/lsof timeout, once per attempt\",\n2499:            \"serve spawn/ready/create/subscribe local transport failure; reconnect ownership timeout; schema mismatch\"\n2501:          \"not_counted\": \"Реальные provider errors (429/free-limit,5xx,provider network), explicit auth/permission/security failure, client_gone, slot rejection и transient child DB errors не маскировать transport failure. Если валидные execution events пришли, но model token нет, first_token_timeout сохраняет обычную provider classification при отсутствии доказанного protocol defect.\",\n2549:          \"compatibility\": \"Proxy credentials only in explicitly required _run_env-selected HTTP(S)/ALL_PROXY values, redacted end-to-end. Config JSON from trusted _run_env retains required provider/options and selected permissions; no merging arbitrary parent secret keys. Standard auth file accessible by preserved HOME/XDG_DATA_HOME; unrelated API keys never child env.\",\n2550:          \"overrides\": \"Then set OPENCODE_DB=:memory:, owned XDG_STATE_HOME/TMPDIR, merge scoped permission policy, and generate fresh OPENCODE_SERVER_PASSWORD last. Child-only secret, never argv/log/lease. Keep models/config on opencode-go and static branches.\",\n2554:          \"trigger\": \"permission.asked on own session or form.created.data.form.sessionID on own session. Immediately latch step_closed/output barrier BEFORE sending any control reply; retain accumulated raw/tool arguments and suppress every later-step text/reasoning.\",\n2557:            \"For own form nested sessionID+nonempty id: cancel on idle Keep-Alive control lane<=0.25s BEFORE title/fields/schema checks; permission reply decision=reject same0.25s. Missing form title still normal cancellation,0ServeHealth increment, no watchdog wait. Missing id/sessionID or any control failure ->fail-closed+own group kill<=1.2s. Never lsof/reconnect on this hot path.\",\n2562:          \"latency\": \"permission/form first reply<=0.25s; immediate subsequent interrupt<=0.10s is distinct control cost within model-execution phase. Final cleanup API aggregate<=0.20s; no new lsof. Only own session/PGID.\",\n2577:            \"helper_lstart\",\n2579:            \"serve_lstart\",\n2584:            \"binary_marker=opencode serve\",\n2589:          \"creation\": \"Parent reserved ownership manifest contains attempt/temp inode before helper Popen; helper immediately creates/updates lease-<attempt_id>.json with helper_pid,helper_lstart,pgid=helper_pid,port,start_ts. Install SIGTERM handler/EOF watcher first; if parent already died EOF is latched, do not launch serve. serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env) in same child_pgid; atomic fsync+replace adds serve_pid and serve_lstart BEFORE stdout handshake {\\\"serve_pid\\\":...,\\\"pgid\\\":...}, then parent lsof/READY/Auth. Check EOF before serve Popen, immediately after it, before/after lease publication/handshake and in <=0.25s monitor loop. No gap depends on parent surviving to publish child identity; helper owns serve Popen->lease publication. helper_proc denotes parent Popen object only; serve_proc denotes helper Popen object only. Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease.\",\n2591:          \"startup_reaper\": \"Before bridge accepts any traffic, even disabled serve: inspect only valid owner-UID leases. Matching live parent PID+parent_start_ts ->skip. Dead parent: validate helper_pid/helper_lstart/pgid and/or serve_pid/serve_lstart using exact uid,pgid,binary path/command/port; helper command is argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart] with exact early argv-position attempt marker and untruncated ps -ww, never opencode listener. When serve still exists require os.getpgid(serve_pid)==stored child_pgid; pid reuse/mismatched lstart/foreign UID/PGID/no manifest/symlink ->no signal, redacted quarantine. While a verified group anchor exists recheck before TERM/KILL; do not infer ownership merely from port/name. Reap/remove only recorded own inode-safe temp root after group absent; reserved manifests with no helper/serve may clean only their proven owned root. No name-wide kill or scanning outside registry. Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease.\",\n2594:          \"tests\": \"VER-005 GroupB inject parent SIGKILL (1) immediately after helper Popen before helper entry/lease, (2) immediately after serve Popen before serve_pid publication, (3) after atomic lease before handshake, (4) after handshake before lsof/READY, (5) during prompt. Same helper→serve group; EOF never lost, helper watcher active before READY. Include TERM-ignoring descendant and terminal_quiescence order (all writers stopped ->owned root removal ->lease unlink ->final same-group KILL; no imagined helper finally after self-KILL). Assert listener_pid==serve_pid and pgid==child_pgid,0 owned helper/serve/descendants/lease/temp roots,0 foreign signals/deletions including PID/PGID reuse. Separately kill/disable helper, restart bridge with retained lease ->safe startup reaper; this is recovery scenario, not immediate EOF success.50 normal cancellation cycles return all counters/FD/thread/pipe counts to0; lifeline_w closed every exit. Stage3/H0/H9 remain NOT_RUN.\",\n2601:            \"parent_dead_single_fault\": \"Helper handles own TERM, reaps cooperative serve; if residual group members ignore TERM, snapshot only child_pgid members by PID/UID/lstart, SIGSTOP each residual member except helper, recheck all group members stopped and repeat to close fork race. No other process/group is touched. Helper remains live group/session leader, preventing PGID reuse. Once all potential writers are quiescent, remove only recorded owned inode-safe temp root and unlink lease as LAST filesystem operation, then final syscall os.killpg(child_pgid,SIGKILL) kills helper and all stopped descendants; no code after it. If no residual members, remove owned files then exit preserving serve termination code. This is cleanup-before-self-KILL, not impossible cleanup-after-self-KILL.\",\n2603:            \"budget\": \"EOF detection<=0.25s; TERM grace<=0.50s; residual identity/stop/reap/root+lease cleanup<=0.45s; total<=1.20s target. No API0.20s cost after parent death. Extra ps identity snapshots run serially on existing helper main loop, at most1 per-slot auxiliary probe, never overlap that slot lsof; resource accounting includes them.\",\n2627:              \"event\": \"ownership failure/timeout\",\n2635:              \"event\": \"first_event_timeout20s, no response headers and no valid execution SSE\",\n2643:              \"event\": \"first_event_timeout20s after headers, no valid execution SSE\",\n2651:              \"event\": \"first_token_timeout/stall with valid protocol and model silence\",\n2659:              \"event\": \"first_token_timeout with proven protocol/capability defect (non-security); valid protocol model silence is the separate preceding row\",\n2667:              \"event\": \"HTTP401/403 or permission/form/capability-security failure\",\n2683:              \"event\": \"HTTP5xx local readiness/create/subscribe endpoint\",\n2714:          \"rules\": \"In auto fallback_to_run only before both barriers and before model/tool output, at most1 fallback after complete cleanup; force serve turns fallback_to_run into explicit failure. serve_retry means explicit admitted same-transport retry after cleanup/status, common cap3/retrytoken/FullJitter and remaining deadlines. If no budget ->fail_closed. Any response headers (including4xx/5xx) latch delivery before status classification. Upstream provider failure committed by existing per-request pending semantics once per cause, not per duplicate step/execution event. Security errors neutral to both health counters but fail-closed. lsof failure counter once per failed attempt;3 ->DEGRADED120s, next auto run without probes. Invalid protocol endpoint signature/security never bypassed by fallback. first_token_timeout branches are mutually exclusive: proven non-security protocol/capability defect ServeHealth+1/UpstreamBreaker0; valid protocol/model silence ServeHealth0/UpstreamBreaker+1. Count exactly once per cause; security capability failures keep fail_closed neutral counters. Delivery barrier/cap3/retry budget unchanged.\"\n2718:          \"process_tree\": \"Exactly1bridge parent ->at most6 helper_proc ->at most6 serve_proc, each pair same child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; <=6 transient bounded lsof/ps identity probes, at most1/slot (no overlap),peak19 processes including bridge. One model attempt token creates one helper/serve pair; MAX_TOTAL_SPAWNS=3 counts pairs/actual serve launches, never free retries; probes auxiliary bounded and accounted. Serve start_new_session=False, helper=True; no alternate process topology.\",\n2720:          \"thread_formula\": \"Parent admitted bound55=1accept+18handlers(6active+12waiters)+6supervisor/setup+6SSE readers+6prompt delivery workers+12helper stdout/stderr drains+6parent bookkeeping. Helper EOF/TERM/serve poll uses one single-thread main loop per slot, no helper watcher threads;<=6 helper processes. serve logs route to helper stderr, stdout reserved for one handshake; parent still accounts2drains/slot. At most6 auxiliary identity/lsof/ps probes total,1per slot,serial nonoverlap with reconnect/cleanup, executed on existing supervisor/helper loops. Peak system processes1bridge+6helper+6serve+6probe=19. Reaper startup-only, no request overlap. Rejected unadmitted ThreadingHTTPServer handlers may be transient:55 is admitted bound; H3 must measure rejection peaks, not claim arbitrary flood defense.\",\n2727:            \"lsof_capture_pipes\": 6,\n2732:            \"aggregate_estimate\": \"Steady parent108 plus transient6lifeline read ends=114<=envelope128. Systemwide conservative128+6serve*20+6helper*8+6probe*8=344descriptors; probe=lsof OR ps identity,at most1/slot,no overlap. Helper per-process8 upper design includes std0/1/2,one transient lease file/atomic temp,DEVNULL/child-launch descriptors and select bookkeeping; measure H3 each process and transient peaks,do not claim aggregate<256.\",\n2760:          \"helper_cli_contract\": \"Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease.\"\n2764:          \"argv\": \"[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]\",\n2765:          \"parent_popen\": \"subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env)\",\n2767:          \"validation\": \"args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants.\",\n2768:          \"entry_isolation\": \"Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes.\",\n2818:        \"lifecycle\": \"Before first real token eligible quiet request gets first status after grace0.30s, then [мост] Ожидание первого токена… with LF every5.0s. After useful model token, STALL_HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_S=15.0: when upstream silent>=15.0s, MUST emit [мост] Ожидание продолжения… +LF and repeat every15.0s while stalled, including pause after very first token. Progress resets heartbeat schedule only from model clock; normal127ms delta never gets heartbeat. Synthetic statuses never reset first-event/first-token/stall watchdog clocks or had_output/usage. Single writer, leading LF separator synthetic provenance.\",\n2819:        \"retry\": \"При действительно принятом retry ровно одна отдельная delta [мост] Повтор попытки 2/3… + LF, далее 3/3. Писать до ожидания backoff после retry admission, не при отказе бюджета. Даже после model reasoning статус не конкатенируется в model bytes. Raw model reasonings всех попыток не дедуплицировать; обычный content prefix dedup остаётся. Synthetic status никогда не участвует в _incomplete_tool_step_prompt, model had_output, usage или accumulated raw reasoning. Перед synthetic status применять status_separator: ведущий LF только в synthetic delta после незавершённой model строки, никогда не в model bytes; статус не входит в watchdog/usage/prompt.\",\n2820:        \"pure_reasoning\": \"Склейка model-origin delta равна upstream model bytes после унаследованной очистки известных interrupted artifacts; не добавлять LF для preview, пробелы и UTF-8 не переписывать. _strip_interrupted должен оставаться chunk-boundary-safe: распознанный interrupted marker удерживается/удаляется инкрементально, partial prefix не протекает; обычный текст не нормализуется. В тестах удалять synthetic delta по provenance/expected list, а не слепо вырезать любую модельную строку [мост]. Перед synthetic status применять status_separator: ведущий LF только в synthetic delta после незавершённой model строки, никогда не в model bytes; статус не входит в watchdog/usage/prompt.\",\n2821:        \"regression\": \"test_interrupted_artifact_removed_from_reasoning_stream: быстрая последовательность marker + Simple greeting. -> exactly Simple greeting., один run, zero status. В JSON тоже exactly. Slow FakeServe: first status <=1.0 s при заблокированном upstream; visible(text.strip) true, latestCompletedParagraphFirstLine получает завершённый LF. Natural reasoning LF обновляет collapsed row, bytes неизменны.\",\n2849:        \"Новые timeout exits транзиентные, budgets/потолки не расширяются.\"\n2877:          \"validation\": \"положительное finite число; недопустимое -> ошибка старта, не бесконечный timeout\",\n2878:          \"env_classification\": \"Новые диагностические/override env-переменные этого пакета: OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_TRANSPORT, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_PERMISSION_POLICY, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_DISABLE_FILE и watchdog overrides OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_FIRST_EVENT_TIMEOUT_S, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_FIRST_TOKEN_TIMEOUT_S, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_STALL_TIMEOUT_S (AD-003). Сам рабочий фичефлаг REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED переключается boolean в dynamic_config.json без новой env для переключения и без правки start.sh/LaunchAgent; кодовый default=false, включение H7 только после H3/H6.\"\n2880:        \"clocks\": \"Общий request deadline TIMEOUT_S=1800 якорится на request t0 и не сбрасывается. Local pre-spawn admission<=5.0s, SERVE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=3.0 и create+subscribe<=2.0 имеют отдельные часы до prompt. Для serve first_event20.0 и first_token60.0 начинаются в prompt_send_start перед первым байтом POST /prompt; first_event удовлетворяется только первым валидным SSE событием исполнения created session после этого момента (session.execution.started/session.step.started/session.reasoning.started, либо валидная текущая model delta). HTTP readiness/headers, server.connected/session.created, чужие/global updates, comments, bridge statuses не гасят first_event и не ставят first_event_ms. Headers POST устанавливают только delivered barrier. Для legacy сохраняется first valid run event/step_start от attempt_start перед startup. first_token — только non-whitespace model reasoning/text или полезный model tool intent; started/control/encrypted-only/reject notification не токен. stall стартует после first_token и обновляется полезными model delta/tool progress; empty ping/status не продлевают. first_event_ms и ttft_ms в O-EXIT относительно request t0, timeout ожидания serve first_event относительно prompt_send_start. При accepted prompt + zero session SSE ->first_event_timeout20s +cleanup<=1.2s, <=22s, не ожидание60s.\",\n2881:        \"disconnect\": \"На каждой итерации/ожидании <=0.25 s проверять cancel flag и client socket select + recv(MSG_PEEK|MSG_DONTWAIT): EOF/ECONNRESET -> client_gone без чтения данных и без переключения wfile в nonblocking. Реальная bounded empty OpenAI keepalive каждые <=2.0 s тишины страхует разрыв, который TCP ещё не сигнализировал; write deadline <=0.5 s, без write на отдельном потоке. Poll, status, write и cleanup не блокируют supervisor на 15/5 s. Суммарное обнаружение контролируемого FIN/RST <=5.0 s. Полное исчезновение сети без FIN нельзя доказать одним MSG_PEEK — bounded write/OS transport timeout и fault injection отдельно, не обещать физически невозможный мгновенный детект blackhole.\",\n2882:        \"cleanup\": \"T-LIFE: после cancel/terminal/watchdog/error/overflow/tool step/success в одном finally: запретить новый prompt/spawn; serve interrupt и DELETE с общим cleanup API ceiling 0.20 s (каждый <=0.10 s, ошибки не блокируют kill); close SSE/control sockets для разблокировки reader; SIGTERM сохранённому own PGID даже если proc.poll уже завершён; grace<=0.50 s, затем SIGKILL тому же PGID при наличии; reap leader и join owned readers/writer <=0.50 s суммарно. Запрет blanket pkill, чужих PID и повторного сигнала переиспользованному PGID после подтверждённого cleanup. cleanup идемпотентен и защищён lock; kill также descendant при leader exit (EVD-055). Target watchdog+2 s и disconnect detect<=5 s + cleanup<=2 s, итог orphan-free<=7 s; не сохранять старые wait(15)+join(5)+kill-parent. После child kill/reap обязателен finally verified removal of owned zen-serve-state-* root (XDG_STATE_HOME/TMPDIR), preserve standard XDG_DATA_HOME; закрыть также daemon prompt delivery socket и join его в том же aggregate cleanup<=1.2s. Interrupt/delete только после ownership proof, никогда чужому listener. Fast API interrupt/delete each0.09s plus0.02 scheduling margin aggregate0.20; no lsof/reconnect. Parent closes lifeline_w in finally; killpg(child_pgid) covers helper_proc+serve_proc+descendants in same group. Parent reaps helper_proc, helper reaps serve_proc. Normal join and root/lease deletion share remaining0.50s; parent-dead helper terminal_quiescence before final self-KILL and startup reaper are specified in AD-001.crash_recovery.\",\n2883:        \"retry\": \"Watchdog first_event/first_token/stall -> bounded common retry after full cleanup, _RequestAttempts/MAX_TOTAL_SPAWNS3/FAIL_RETRY_LIMIT/_RetryBudget/Full Jitter как ранее. Но serve-specific no-session-event/invalid_serve_event/EOF классифицируются _ServeHealth и НЕ _UpstreamBreaker; общие provider failures по-прежнему model breaker. При DELIVERED silent run fallback запрещён: retry текущего запроса остаётся явным на закреплённом транспорте, health TTL влияет только на последующие auto requests. Legacy watchdog сохраняет provider semantics. client_gone/fatal4xx/auth/permission ->no retry/fallback. HALF_OPEN owner token жив до завершения/cleanup, cooldown не допускает второй probe; neutral transport failure/cancel освобождает probe без fake provider success/failure. Slot один на запрос, release once; cancel-aware waits<=.25s; Full Jitter capped remaining. Decision table AD-001.fallback_decision_table is authoritative for phases/counter effects, including first_event before/after headers.\",\n2884:        \"telemetry\": \"_new_exit_state устанавливает transport=none, first_event_ms=null, ttft_ms=null до любого early exit. _log_exit на КАЖДОМ do_POST exit ровно один O-EXIT/v1 с transport(run|serve|google|none), first_event_ms и ttft_ms относительно request t0 (без status/keepalive), exit_reason и общими total_spawns/retries; attempt-local timings отдельно для диагностики. Путь с fallback показывает last transport и transport_history=[serve,run], секретов/промпта/endpoint password нет. Новый primary exit_reason не перетирается generic timeout; финальная успешная retry даёт ok + attempt exit history. Все 4 timeout/client codes проверяются на stream и JSON, including exits до попытки. HTTP readiness НЕ first_event_ms: поле null до valid SSE execution current session после prompt_send_start. transport_history фиксирует отказ serve/TTL run или probe без secrets и phantom Popen; отдельный reason для protocol/model/security. early HTTP headers не ставят ни first_event_ms, ни ttft_ms.\"\n2895:        \"Новый regex-parser на каждом delta — теряет разрезанные теги/JSON/UTF-8 и дублирует контракт.\",\n2932:        \"parser\": \"Каждый session.text.delta -> тот же parser.feed без промежуточного whole-step buffer. Outside genuine tool blocks удерживается только pending opener prefix <=max(len(<tool_call>),len(<tool_invoke>))-1=12 chars плюс нужный существующему code-context lookahead; open block удерживается до валидного close, JSON close внутри строки не закрывает блок. Genuine/unparsed/incomplete tool tags не попадают в delta.content: callbacks через _strip_broken_tool_blocks и chunk-safe finish; существующие намеренно цитированные теги в Markdown остаются документационным текстом по текущим parser fixtures (не выполнять их). Инвариант по всем split points и single-character chunks. Open-block/total-output/frame bounds проверяются отдельно, overflow -> explicit error+cleanup.\",\n2933:        \"step\": \"Accumulated raw text/reasoning/native + step.ended tokens -> _is_incomplete_tool_step/_incomplete_step_signal и _is_transient_stream_error. При step.ended с готовым вызовом немедленно завершить upstream, finish_reason=tool_calls; не пропускать SYNTHETIC Continue. Error до первого model output допускает bounded recovery upstream как legacy; поздняя transient error прерывает attempt, fatal 400/401/403/404/422 без retry. Bridge status не изменяет attempt_output/first_token/had_error. _strip_interrupted и _strip_broken_tool_blocks работают независимо от границ delta. Native called.data.input absent: input.ended.data.text parsed once as complete JSON supplies tool arguments even streaming→failed. permission reject/form cancel latch single-turn barrier BEFORE control; immediately interrupt and return mapped tools or existing recovery, never Step2 output.\",\n2935:        \"red_green\": \"Сначала dedicated tests на текущем коде: реальный socket read до release upstream Event, slow initial status, watchdog/cleanup и native delta split. Зафиксировать red (не import error), после Stage 3 green в VER-005 и полном VER-001/002. Stage 2 тестовый код не пишет и зелёное выполнение этой будущей поверхности не заявляет. AC-026 / VER-005 / Clean-Room L2: tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py создаёт tmp_path / \\\"dynamic_config.json\\\" с {\\\"REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED\\\":true}; monkeypatch.setattr(server, \\\"DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH\\\", cfg_path, raising=False). При переносе только этого testfile на непропатченный origin/dev нет AttributeError: реально POST /v1/chat/completions, RED именно на поведенческих realtime chunk intervals (чтение socket до upstream release), GREEN на новом коде. Та же Server instance: атомарно false в cfg_path ->следующий запрос run без restart; true ->serve при test eligibility override/native, deletion/invalid JSON/nonbool/unreadable ->false; unchanged (st_mtime_ns,st_size) ->нет reopen. Новый cfg stat key для переключения обеспечивается и проверяется тестом, без sleep-предположений. Existing378 tests не создают JSON и остаются run. Runtime результаты NOT_RUN.\"\n2973:      \"environment\": \"auto с кодовым default=false; runtime dynamic_config.json=true после H7/H3/H6 + native eligibility; explicit env disabled/run/disable-file/TTL ->run\",\n2992:      \"response_measure\": \"20/60/60 config, scaled tests, timeout+2s cleanup и spawns<=3\",\n3020:      \"response_measure\": \"fake permission requests reject; false flag no secret allocation; live H6 отдельно\",\n3031:      \"environment\": \"SSE или JSON, valid/malformed request\",\n3099:        \"_run_env/_RequestAttempts/_StartupGate\",\n3155:      \"change\": \"Grace=.30s synthetic [мост] status delta с LF для thinking-enabled slow/retry lifecycle; fast/off/JSON не получают prefix. Разрешено текущим Brief AD-002 и REQ-004/005. Mandatory eligible stall heartbeat threshold=interval15.0s even after first token; pre-token heartbeat5.0s; reasoning provenance and leading LF unchanged.\",\n3208:      \"mitigation\": \"Default ask_reject в отдельном _serve_env поверх byte-identical _run_env; wire permission.asked ->decision=reject немедленно, never once/always/allow. Env deny поддержан без пересборки, без automatic policy fallback. 401/403/нет safe endpoint fail-closed; FakeServe обе policy, реальный H6 обязателен.\",\n3230:      \"mitigation\": \"OPENCODE_DB=:memory:, standard XDG_DATA_HOME/auth preserved, owned state/temp finally+crash reaper; EVD-071 zero common DB opens. H3 actual parent+all6serve/pairedhelpers/lsof<=1638.4MiB and zero locks on103KB×6×3; real auth not proven by provider-free access. disable-file retained on FAIL, no slot/retry increases. Units MiB. EVD-079 final actual helper peak=31.718750; helper_estimate36.0 reserves 4.281250 for Stage3 helper code/lease/drain bookkeeping (design allowance, not live proof). Serve idle156.8 + helper36.0 =192.8; probe8.0 -> combined200.8; per_slot_ceiling216.0 gives15.2>=15 MiB for103KB prompts.6*216=1296 shared;1296+256=1552.0<=0.80*2048=1638.4; station headroom86.4.6slots/12waiters/cap3 unchanged. H3 NOT_RUN until live6parallel103KB×3; any actual slot>216 or total>1638.4 blocks H7 without waiver. Helpers/probes/load must be summed, not omitted.\",\n3249:      \"scenario\": \"Расщеплённые marker/tool/UTF8 или ended duplicate искажают reasoning/usage\",\n3252:      \"mitigation\": \"Canonical delta-only assembler, incremental scrubber, all split points, step-id dedup/native-call-id dedup; end barrier independent terminal.\",\n3285:      \"mitigation\": \"Decode wire JSON as object with isinstance narrowing/TypedDict; new code no Any/casts-to-Any/type-ignore. VER-004 uses isolated bridge cwd + temporary include/extraPaths: all3 errorCount==0, new test0diagnostics, server Any<=125each/nonAny per-rule and total<=720, step<=194; changed legacy code0reportAny/reportExplicitAny/reportUnusedCallResult. Preserve public module attribute server.CATALOG_SOURCE and HTTP catalog_source: module-level CATALOG_SOURCE = \\\"static\\\", never rename it or external test references. Replace reload_catalog global CATALOG_SOURCE/reassignment with typed def _set_catalog_source(source: str) -> None: globals()[\\\"CATALOG_SOURCE\\\"] = source; keep only _catalog_mtime/_catalog_ids in reload_catalog global declaration. Preserve static import zen_catalog as zc in the normal-server else branch (original import server.py:67); it remains the only permitted E402 location if a finding exists, zero E402 findings is valid; guard proc is not None before both final stream .returncode reads. EVD-076 observed errorCount0 without # type: ignore; tests/test_catalog_mode.py:64,93 unchanged,8tests PASS on copy. coder_target_files remains exactly3; no config/dependency/new module. Full all3 Stage3 gate NOT_RUN. Ruff==0.17.2 legacy ranges use only --range={start}:1-{end}:999; reject any old/new diff hunk intersecting _run_env/_stream_google_sse/_execute_google_once and check their literal raw hashes before and after formatter. Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease. EVD-076 static-import server warningCount564/reportAny125, EVD-077 full local block exit0 with catalog8/8; source init→static transition is probe-only. Actual Stage3 NOT_RUN. Write-mode range formatting must run on disposable candidate copy and assert_frozen(copy), never write product during architecture probe.\",\n3292:      \"scenario\": \"Prompt POST timeout уже после принятия способен удвоить generation при silent fallback\",\n3351:        \"mitigation\": \"Родитель резервирует 127.0.0.1:0 и запускает только helper_proc с argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], start_new_session=True; child_pgid=helper_proc.pid. Helper устанавливает EOF/TERM надзор до spawn, атомарно публикует lease и запускает serve_proc с start_new_session=False в той же группе child_pgid; публикует serve_pid/serve_lstart до handshake/READY. --serve-helper <attempt_id> находится в первых аргументах ps -ww argv. До отправки любых Authorization/пароля или prompt обязательны одновременно listener_pid == serve_pid, os.getpgid(listener_pid) == child_pgid и helper_proc.poll() is None; ровно один lsof с бюджетом <=0.35s внутри общего ready<=3.0s. На mismatch/timeout/неоднозначность 0 байт Authorization/пароля/prompt, fail-closed, retry только внутри исходного ready/cap3 после cleanup. Cleanup os.killpg(child_pgid, SIGTERM→SIGKILL) охватывает подтверждённые собственные helper + serve + потомков, с lifeline/reap/root+lease cleanup по crash_recovery; чужой PID в той же или иной группе получает 0 байт пароля и 0 сигналов чужому PGID. Секреты только sanitized env, без argv/lease/log; no redirects/proxy. Normal Keep-Alive control path не вызывает повторный lsof; отдельный explicit reconnect имеет собственный proof, как listener_ownership. Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease.\",\n3359:        \"mitigation\": \"Default OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_PERMISSION_POLICY=ask_reject; _serve_env вызывает неизменный _run_env ровно один раз и sanitizes все3 ветки, permission={\\\"*\\\":\\\"ask\\\"}, session effect=ask; никогда allow/once/always. permission.asked своей сессии ->single-turn barrier, decision=reject<=0.25s, затем interrupt<=0.10s, не ждать prompt completion. deny selectable до attempt, никогда auto-switch/разрешение или silent run fallback после delivered; unsupported capability/policy ->fail-closed. For form.created first inspect nested data.form object: if data.form.sessionID==active_session_id and data.form.id is a nonempty string, latch single-turn/Step2 barrier and IMMEDIATELY send POST /api/session/{id}/form/{formID}/cancel on retained control lane<=0.25s, then interrupt<=0.10s, BEFORE validating title/fields/metadata or emitting invalid_serve_event. EVD-073 source Form.Info requires id,sessionID,title,fields (only root metadata optional; field-level title/required optional). Missing root title is a schema discrepancy but safety cancel is authoritative: successful cancel+interrupt completes normal cancelled attempt with ServeHealth+0/UpstreamBreaker+0, no watchdog60s wait and no Step2. This does not relabel source title optional. Missing/invalid id or sessionID ->immediate fail-closed(no foreign cancel); cancel failure/control disconnect ->immediate fail-closed; parent finally killpg(child_pgid) completes<=1.2s, no watchdog wait. Valid foreign nested sessionID ignored with0foreigncontrol. form.cancelled.data.id/sessionID settles only same owned form; not model token or first-event. Полный single_turn_control.order авторитетен: raw tool args/input.ended fallback сохраняются, готовый mapped call возвращается ровно один раз finish_reason=tool_calls, иначе существующее recovery в cap3; никакого Step2. _run_env, tests/test_run_env.py побайтно неизменны. EVD-050 + [F-08] обосновывают выбор ask_reject; FakeServe не доказывает живую Zen-совместимость или запрет записи, это H6 NOT_RUN.\",\n3367:        \"mitigation\": \"_run_env only standalone branch whitelists; opencode-go/static inherit parent env baseline. New _serve_env filters exact allowlist on ALL3 branches before generated password/DB/state values, preserving only required routing/catalog/proxy/auth paths. OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_* and arbitrary API_KEY/TOKEN/SECRET sentinels absent; config/log/lease redacted. See AD-001.serve_env_sanitization; VER-005 branch matrix. _run_env remains byte-identical. Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, s