s.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease. EVD-076 static-import server warningCount564/reportAny125, EVD-077 full local block exit0 with catalog8/8; source init→static transition is probe-only. Actual Stage3 NOT_RUN. Write-mode range formatting must run on disposable candidate copy and assert_frozen(copy), never write product during architecture probe.\"\n3633:      \"FD_worker\": \"Design parent ceiling128;steady108=36baseline+18clients+18HTTP+12helperdrains+6reserve+6probe pipes+6lifeline_w+6leasehandles;transient6lifeline_r=>114<=128.6serve/6helper/6bounded lsof-or-ps probes separate FD,system344estimate. H3 per-process/transient peaks mandatory.\",\n3635:      \"λ_new_conn_per_pod(s)\": \"AD-001: <=3 readiness connects including reusable control, +1 SSE +1 prompt delivery +1 egress =6 per attempt; node<=6*.2*3=3.6conn/s; active<=5*6=30 incl client+3HTTP+egress. sharedSNAT1.8/active12 estimate unchanged; H3 validate.\",\n3636:      \"C_active_in_scope(s)\": \"AD-001: <=3 readiness connects including reusable control, +1 SSE +1 prompt delivery +1 egress =6 per attempt; node<=6*.2*3=3.6conn/s; active<=5*6=30 incl client+3HTTP+egress. sharedSNAT1.8/active12 estimate unchanged; H3 validate.\",\n3651:      \"thread_accounting\": \"Parent admitted bound55=1accept+18handlers(6active+12waiters)+6supervisor/setup+6SSE readers+6prompt delivery workers+12helper stdout/stderr drains+6parent bookkeeping. Helper EOF/TERM/serve poll uses one single-thread main loop per slot, no helper watcher threads;<=6 helper processes. serve logs route to helper stderr, stdout reserved for one handshake; parent still accounts2drains/slot. At most6 auxiliary identity/lsof/ps probes total,1per slot,serial nonoverlap with reconnect/cleanup, executed on existing supervisor/helper loops. Peak system processes1bridge+6helper+6serve+6probe=19. Reaper startup-only, no request overlap. Rejected unadmitted ThreadingHTTPServer handlers may be transient:55 is admitted bound; H3 must measure rejection peaks, not claim arbitrary flood defense.\",\n3656:      \"byte_limits_policy\": \"Только новый enabled transport, суммарный parent queue/raw/parser/dedup/visible output budget на request контролируется; превышение -> прежняя error shape + explicit output_overflow и cleanup, не молчаливое drop. Не вводить новый запрет на размер accepted prompt и не менять legacy limits. При нагрузке/длинном reasoning H3 измерить Python overhead и CPU.\",\n3657:      \"first_status_delay_s\": 0.3,\n3659:      \"first_event_timeout_s\": 20,\n3660:      \"first_token_timeout_s\": 60,\n3661:      \"stall_timeout_s\": 60,\n3665:      \"client_write_timeout_s\": 0.5,\n3675:      \"admission_policy\": \"_StartupGate + _SpawnRateLimiter делят один<=5.0s deadline на attempt; никакой суммы независимых5+5. Spawn token hard, gate wait fail-open только в остатке.\",\n3691:        \"lsof_capture_pipes\": 6,\n3696:        \"aggregate_estimate\": \"Steady parent108 plus transient6lifeline read ends=114<=envelope128. Systemwide conservative128+6serve*20+6helper*8+6probe*8=344descriptors; probe=lsof OR ps identity,at most1/slot,no overlap. Helper per-process8 upper design includes std0/1/2,one transient lease file/atomic temp,DEVNULL/child-launch descriptors and select bookkeeping; measure H3 each process and transient peaks,do not claim aggregate<256.\",\n3700:      \"process_accounting\": \"Exactly1bridge parent ->at most6 helper_proc ->at most6 serve_proc, each pair same child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; <=6 transient bounded lsof/ps identity probes, at most1/slot (no overlap),peak19 processes including bridge. One model attempt token creates one helper/serve pair; MAX_TOTAL_SPAWNS=3 counts pairs/actual serve launches, never free retries; probes auxiliary bounded and accounted. Serve start_new_session=False, helper=True; no alternate process topology.\",\n3705:        \"rollout\": \"Both normal p99 target and degraded-profile budget must be measured independently; no runtime SLA claim from arithmetic. If normal p99>180 or degraded synthetic p99>231.6, keep disabled and return evidence, do not increase caps/timeouts.\"\n3845:      \"C-MULT-I1\": {\n3847:        \"substitution\": \"Bridge process1,6 exclusive serve leases,G_reload1; georouter6<=.60*80=48. Logical opencode_local_db6<=.60*10=6 is accounting not vendor pool. OPENCODE_DB=:memory: means0shared SQLite files; auth preserved at standard data dir. Helpers<=6/lsof<=6 bounded separately; combined child/helper/lsof estimate1296MiB and parent256 gives1552<=1638.4MiB, runtime PASS only H3 full sum and0locks.\",\n3855:      \"C-MULT-I2\": {\n3864:      \"C-MULT-I3\": {\n3873:      \"C-MULT-I4\": {\n3875:        \"substitution\": \"Любой timeout/cancel на slot/gate/ready/prompt/read/write вызывает общий finally; cleanup idempotent; counters waiters/in_use/children/sockets возвращаются0; disconnect не запускает retry.\",\n3882:      \"C-MULT-I5\": {\n3884:        \"substitution\": \"ParentFD steady108 +6 transient lifeline_r=114<=envelope128<=0.70*65536=45875.2. System128+6serve20+6helper8+6probe8=344descriptors; probe=lsof/ps at most1/slot nonoverlap. Parent55admitted threads,peak19processes. lifeline_w always finally closes; helper and serve share child_pgid=helper_proc.pid.3HTTP lanes/serve; nodeports3.6*60+30=246<=8192,SNAT1.8*60+12=120<=8192,0probe network. RSS serve156.8+helper_estimate36+probe~8=200.8MiB under216/slot,full1552<=1638.4; helper isolated RSS observed EVD-079; loaded serve/probe and full envelope remain estimates until live H3.\",\n3885:        \"oracle\": \"Entire normal Keep-Alive path(permission/form/reply/interrupt/DELETE),including50controls:exactly1 lsof/successful spawn and1retained control TCP. Separate explicit control-socket reconnect scenario permits only2nd lsof<=0.35s outside reply0.25s/cleanupAPI0.20s; spies distinguish the scenarios; urgent control disconnect is fail-closed,never lsof wait.3forced lsof timeouts ->3ServeHealth failures->DEGRADED,nextauto has0serve/helper/lsof Popen. Check listener_pid==serve_pid and pgid==helper_proc.pid; count lifeline2ends during setup/one parent end thereafter,all0afterfinally; parentFD<=128,allprocess344design,55admittedthreads,19systemprocesspeak; probes1/slot. H3 measures actual RSS/FD/thread/ports and rejects excess without raising limits.\",\n3929:          \"transitive_call_graph\": \"Handler.do_POST -> {Handler._stream_sse, Handler._serve_json -> Run.execute -> Run._execute_once}; common source -> {legacy _spawn_with_stdin/_StdoutFeed/parse_opencode_event, managed serve HTTP+SSE adapter}; both -> ToolCallParser/_split_tool_calls/_strip_interrupted/_strip_broken_tool_blocks/_incomplete_step_signal; common _RequestAttempts -> _Resilience(slots,spawn_limiter,retry_budget,breaker), _StartupGate, _run_env -> _next_standalone_proxy; cleanup -> interrupt/delete, sockets.close, own killpg/reap. Google branch dispatches before serve. No new callers outside Handler/tests, no bridge callers to Redis/PG/Vault, Control Plane/Snapshot fetch, asyncio, node eligibility/quarantine/singleflight. Catalog functions inherited, no new route snapshot/cache path introduced.\",\n3951:          \"transitive_call_graph\": \"Handler.do_POST -> {Handler._stream_sse, Handler._serve_json -> Run.execute -> Run._execute_once}; common source -> {legacy _spawn_with_stdin/_StdoutFeed/parse_opencode_event, managed serve HTTP+SSE adapter}; both -> ToolCallParser/_split_tool_calls/_strip_interrupted/_strip_broken_tool_blocks/_incomplete_step_signal; common _RequestAttempts -> _Resilience(slots,spawn_limiter,retry_budget,breaker), _StartupGate, _run_env -> _next_standalone_proxy; cleanup -> interrupt/delete, sockets.close, own killpg/reap. Google branch dispatches before serve. No new callers outside Handler/tests, no bridge callers to Redis/PG/Vault, Control Plane/Snapshot fetch, asyncio, node eligibility/quarantine/singleflight. Catalog functions inherited, no new route snapshot/cache path introduced.\",\n3957:        \"substitution\": \"Не вводится Control Plane/Snapshot/SWR/readiness endpoint; публичный /health unchanged; auth password живёт ровно до cleanup, 401 fail-closed.\",\n3963:        \"reason\": \"Не вводится Control Plane/Snapshot/SWR/readiness endpoint; публичный /health unchanged; auth password живёт ровно до cleanup, 401 fail-closed.\",\n3973:          \"transitive_call_graph\": \"Handler.do_POST -> {Handler._stream_sse, Handler._serve_json -> Run.execute -> Run._execute_once}; common source -> {legacy _spawn_with_stdin/_StdoutFeed/parse_opencode_event, managed serve HTTP+SSE adapter}; both -> ToolCallParser/_split_tool_calls/_strip_interrupted/_strip_broken_tool_blocks/_incomplete_step_signal; common _RequestAttempts -> _Resilience(slots,spawn_limiter,retry_budget,breaker), _StartupGate, _run_env -> _next_standalone_proxy; cleanup -> interrupt/delete, sockets.close, own killpg/reap. Google branch dispatches before serve. No new callers outside Handler/tests, no bridge callers to Redis/PG/Vault, Control Plane/Snapshot fetch, asyncio, node eligibility/quarantine/singleflight. Catalog functions inherited, no new route snapshot/cache path introduced.\",\n3979:      \"H-CPU-I1\": {\n3997:          \"transitive_call_graph\": \"Handler.do_POST -> {Handler._stream_sse, Handler._serve_json -> Run.execute -> Run._execute_once}; common source -> {legacy _spawn_with_stdin/_StdoutFeed/parse_opencode_event, managed serve HTTP+SSE adapter}; both -> ToolCallParser/_split_tool_calls/_strip_interrupted/_strip_broken_tool_blocks/_incomplete_step_signal; common _RequestAttempts -> _Resilience(slots,spawn_limiter,retry_budget,breaker), _StartupGate, _run_env -> _next_standalone_proxy; cleanup -> interrupt/delete, sockets.close, own killpg/reap. Google branch dispatches before serve. No new callers outside Handler/tests, no bridge callers to Redis/PG/Vault, Control Plane/Snapshot fetch, asyncio, node eligibility/quarantine/singleflight. Catalog functions inherited, no new route snapshot/cache path introduced.\",\n4001:      \"H-CPU-I2\": {\n4004:        \"oracle\": \"Спай на re._compile/config decoder/model_validate/typeadapter/deepcopy/static labels в delta loop ->0; wire decoder count==one per actual event, не full history; tool JSON parser exempt by input decoding purpose.\",\n4010:      \"H-CPU-I3\": {\n4012:        \"substitution\": \"Первые guards: explicit env disabled/TRANSPORT=run ->legacy до stat/UUID/password/clock/queue/threads/probe. Disable-file O(1)/open sticky TTL ->run; force serve только после этих guards. Auto dynamic config stat O(1) cache(mtime_ns,size), unchanged без JSON parsing/reopen, missing/invalid/unreadable/nonbool default=false; enabled native only ->serve. Config reload bounded, selector overhead<1мс — будущий VER005/H9 oracle, не измеренный PASS. Legacy watchdog/status RC2/RC3 остаются; status thinking+SSE guard before format, bounded put_nowait, explicit overflow+cleanup.\",\n4019:      \"H-CPU-I4\": {\n4037:          \"transitive_call_graph\": \"Handler.do_POST -> {Handler._stream_sse, Handler._serve_json -> Run.execute -> Run._execute_once}; common source -> {legacy _spawn_with_stdin/_StdoutFeed/parse_opencode_event, managed serve HTTP+SSE adapter}; both -> ToolCallParser/_split_tool_calls/_strip_interrupted/_strip_broken_tool_blocks/_incomplete_step_signal; common _RequestAttempts -> _Resilience(slots,spawn_limiter,retry_budget,breaker), _StartupGate, _run_env -> _next_standalone_proxy; cleanup -> interrupt/delete, sockets.close, own killpg/reap. Google branch dispatches before serve. No new callers outside Handler/tests, no bridge callers to Redis/PG/Vault, Control Plane/Snapshot fetch, asyncio, node eligibility/quarantine/singleflight. Catalog functions inherited, no new route snapshot/cache path introduced.\",\n4041:      \"H-CPU-I5\": {\n4043:        \"substitution\": \"Inherited CPU estimates t_req=.02,t_attempt=.05; total=.17CPU-s, util=1×.2×.17/(1×1)+.02=.054<=.70; pod=.054+.25=.304<=.8×2=1.6; допускается Δt_feature<=.10 CPU-s/request =>Δcores=.2×.10=.02<=.05×(1×2)=.10. Event path up to60frames/s; никакого повторного full-history regex/JSON parse в delta loop. Дельта .10CPU-s — budget, не замер.\",\n4052:      \"R-BULK-I1\": {\n4054:        \"substitution\": \"15.0 + 3 * (5.0 + 3.0 + 2.0 + 1.2) + 3.0 = 51.6 s <= 0.30 * 180 = 54.0 s; headroom=2.4s. Slot15 один раз, combined pre-spawn admission5 на attempt, owner/ready3, create+subscribe2, cleanup1.2, суммарный backoff cap1+2=3. Prompt POST/generation под first_event20/first_token60/stall60 и total1800, не session_setup. Каждому I/O timeout=min(phase_remaining,request_remaining); cleanup финальный<=1.2 даже после request deadline. После deadline ни spawn/prompt/sleep.\",\n4055:        \"oracle\": \"FakeClock recompute51.6<=54 и headroom>=2.0; admission gate+limiter sum<=5.0, ready3/create+subscribe2/cleanup1.2, prompt POST не входит в2s; slow create timeout ->one budgeted run pre-header; headers received or session event ->zero silent run, Popen<=3. Deadline exhausted->zero further I/O. Никаких leftover gate5+spawn5/ready.5/setup.2. Owner proof0.35 inside ready3s, no lsof in cleanup. Control reconnect0.35 is explicit recovery inside execution budget, never urgent-reply/cleanup SLA; urgent failure kills instead. Normal p99 and degraded231.6s criteria separate.\",\n4061:      \"R-BULK-I2\": {\n4070:      \"R-BULK-I3\": {\n4072:        \"substitution\": \"Model _UpstreamBreaker threshold5/cooldown10*U(.8,1.2), HALF_OPEN1 owner не освобождается по одному cooldown до terminal/cleanup; provider failures/успешное восстановление как прежде. Отдельный _ServeHealth threshold3/TTL120/one recovery probe для serve protocol-only failures; first_event_timeout без session execution и invalid_serve_event НЕ model breaker failure, subsequent auto->run. Accepted current prompt не получает silent run fallback. Auth/permission/security401/403 fail-closed, no policy switch; client cancel neutral. TTL/run skips не продлевают outage; native binary key change инвалидирует capability/health. Resource/retry/slot caps едины.\",\n4073:        \"oracle\": \"После5 failing requests OPEN без connect/spawn; FakeClock до cooldown десять concurrent HALF_OPEN ->ровно1 probe. Продвинуть clock ещё на>reset_s при заблокированной первой пробе: allow для остальных остаётся false. После owner cleanup проба освобождена и следующая ровно одна разрешена. fake401/403 не запускает run fallback и не выдаёт secret. Отдельно five serve-protocol failures forced mode ->model breaker closed, no .failure calls; auto third failure arms120s,next auto run, no silent replay current request; atTTL exactly1probe, success resets, failed protocol rearms120; provider5 failures still open model breaker. Parametrize AD-001 fallback_decision_table rows exactly, counters once/cause. preheader20s->budgeted run, afterheader20s->explicit serve_retry; HTTP401/403 neverfallback; local preprompt5xx transport vs promptprovider5xx model. lsof proof timeout3->TTLrun/modelbreaker0.\",\n4079:      \"R-BULK-I4\": {\n4097:          \"transitive_call_graph\": \"Handler.do_POST -> {Handler._stream_sse, Handler._serve_json -> Run.execute -> Run._execute_once}; common source -> {legacy _spawn_with_stdin/_StdoutFeed/parse_opencode_event, managed serve HTTP+SSE adapter}; both -> ToolCallParser/_split_tool_calls/_strip_interrupted/_