e/descendants/lease/temp roots,0 foreign signals/deletions including PID/PGID reuse. Separately kill/disable helper, restart bridge with retained lease ->safe startup reaper; this is recovery scenario, not immediate EOF success.50 normal cancellation cycles return all counters/FD/thread/pipe counts to0; lifeline_w closed every exit. Stage3/H0/H9 remain NOT_RUN.\",\n4131:      \"helper_cli_contract\": \"Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease.\"\n4135:      \"substitution\": \"Один O-EXIT/v1 до любого early return имеет mode/model/status, transport/first_event_ms/ttft_ms (null допустим до event), exit_reason, retries,total_spawns,duration; code first_event_timeout/first_token_timeout/stall_timeout/client_gone не теряется. first_event_ms только valid current-session execution SSE после prompt, относительно request t0; HTTPready/POST headers не являются first_event. transport_history/reason раздельно protocol/model/security/TTL, no phantom spawns. REQ-016/AC-021 authorize listed fields; fallback reason in adjacent BRIDGE-TRANSPORT/v1 diagnostic if strict O-EXIT parser; never rename/remove existing keys/types. Always log transport=serve|run with redacted cause; /health unchanged.\",\n4153:        \"transitive_call_graph\": \"Handler.do_POST -> {Handler._stream_sse, Handler._serve_json -> Run.execute -> Run._execute_once}; common source -> {legacy _spawn_with_stdin/_StdoutFeed/parse_opencode_event, managed serve HTTP+SSE adapter}; both -> ToolCallParser/_split_tool_calls/_strip_interrupted/_strip_broken_tool_blocks/_incomplete_step_signal; common _RequestAttempts -> _Resilience(slots,spawn_limiter,retry_budget,breaker), _StartupGate, _run_env -> _next_standalone_proxy; cleanup -> interrupt/delete, sockets.close, own killpg/reap. Google branch dispatches before serve. No new callers outside Handler/tests, no bridge callers to Redis/PG/Vault, Control Plane/Snapshot fetch, asyncio, node eligibility/quarantine/singleflight. Catalog functions inherited, no new route snapshot/cache path introduced.\",\n4165:        \"dependency_operation\": \"serve/readiness + session init\",\n4167:        \"timeout_budget\": \"Owner proof+GET /api/session/active aggregate ready<=3.0s (cache-miss schema внутри3); POST session+GET event armed<=2.0s; POST prompt excluded, concurrent SSE/watchdogs\",\n4169:        \"circuit_breaker\": \"_ServeHealth3/TTL120/probe1 for protocol; _UpstreamBreaker5 for provider; auth/permission fail-closed\",\n4170:        \"failure_mode_fallback\": \"Auto ServeUnavailable до POST prompt response headers и до current-session execution event ->cleanup+budgeted run. Headers OR event latch delivered; then no silent run.401/403/permission missing never fallback.\"\n4175:        \"timeout_budget\": \"Serve first-event20/first-token60 от prompt_send_start; stall60 от useful token; requestTIMEOUT1800 common. HTTP readiness отдельно<=3 и не гасит first_event.\",\n4181:        \"dependency_operation\": \"_StartupGate/_SpawnRateLimiter\",\n4183:        \"timeout_budget\": \"Shared pre-spawn admission<=5.0s total (gate wait only remaining after hard token); hold<=12 not additive, cancel poll<=.25\",\n4186:        \"failure_mode_fallback\": \"Gate wait fail-open лишь в оставшемся5s; token timeout prohibits spawn, limiter never bypassed. No independent5+5 waits.\"\n4191:        \"timeout_budget\": \"Existing verified Keep-Alive control only: interrupt<=.09+DELETE<=.09+.02 scheduling=.20;TERMgrace<=.50;all reap/join/helper/temp/lease<=.50;total1.20. No lsof/reconnect on cleanup.\",\n4199:        \"timeout_budget\": \"probe<=.25, empty keepalive<=2 silence, write<=.5; detect<=5\",\n4202:        \"failure_mode_fallback\": \"FIN/RST ->client_gone+cleanup, no retry; slow consumer/overflow ->explicit terminal error if writable; hard write timeout cancels\"\n4207:        \"timeout_budget\": \"существующая synchronous append baseline; новые строки bounded/redacted, status write не зависит от log\",\n4213:        \"dependency_operation\": \"serve permission reject / form cancel / single-turn interrupt\",\n4215:        \"timeout_budget\": \"reject or form cancel<=.25 from event, then interrupt<=.10; no await prompt/lsof/reconnect; second-step output barrier immediate.\",\n4218:        \"failure_mode_fallback\": \"permission.asked->decision reject OR nested form.created->cancel; then immediate interrupt. Control failure ->fail-closed+group kill, no allow, no Step2 output.\"\n4223:      \"C-MULT-I1\",\n4224:      \"C-MULT-I2\",\n4225:      \"C-MULT-I3\",\n4226:      \"C-MULT-I4\",\n4227:      \"C-MULT-I5\",\n4233:      \"H-CPU-I1\",\n4234:      \"H-CPU-I2\",\n4235:      \"H-CPU-I3\",\n4236:      \"H-CPU-I4\",\n4237:      \"H-CPU-I5\",\n4238:      \"R-BULK-I1\",\n4239:      \"R-BULK-I2\",\n4240:      \"R-BULK-I3\",\n4241:      \"R-BULK-I4\",\n4242:      \"R-BULK-I5\",\n4290:      \"rationale\": \"Клиент видит прежний OpenAI SSE/JSON. Password/session/control events не уходят в content; [мост] — явно разрешённый status REQ-005.\",\n4360:        \"transitive_call_graph\": \"Handler.do_POST -> {Handler._stream_sse, Handler._serve_json -> Run.execute -> Run._execute_once}; common source -> {legacy _spawn_with_stdin/_StdoutFeed/parse_opencode_event, managed serve HTTP+SSE adapter}; both -> ToolCallParser/_split_tool_calls/_strip_interrupted/_strip_broken_tool_blocks/_incomplete_step_signal; common _RequestAttempts -> _Resilience(slots,spawn_limiter,retry_budget,breaker), _StartupGate, _run_env -> _next_standalone_proxy; cleanup -> interrupt/delete, sockets.close, own killpg/reap. Google branch dispatches before serve. No new callers outside Handler/tests, no bridge callers to Redis/PG/Vault, Control Plane/Snapshot fetch, asyncio, node eligibility/quarantine/singleflight. Catalog functions inherited, no new route snapshot/cache path introduced.\",\n4366:      \"rationale\": \"Queue.get/select c конечным timeout, FakeClock/RNG tests; readiness<=3 connects, никакого busy-spin polling.\",\n4398:      \"rationale\": \"ask_reject/deny never allow; explicit brief chooses responseheaders OR sessionexecution deliverybarrier. Beforebarrier unknown delivery may fallback only after ownedcleanup/cap; afterbarrier only explicit same-transport retry+status, never silentrun. Not exactly-once; tool IDs dedup.\",\n4453:    \"FakeServe\": \"Stdlib subprocess implements exact frozen_v2_1_2_fixtures API/SSE, Basic401, /api/session/active, /openapi.json only per binary-key first handshake, session/prompt/interrupt/delete/permission decision=reject. Tests force serve for shebang; no Zen calls. Independent fixed fixture digest oracle + deliberate field/schema mutations; fake/adapter mutual agreement alone insufficient. GET active returns {data:{}} not[]; once-per-key /api/info version+PID and API schema info.version0.0.1, independent binary appversion2.1.2; invalid numeric error.status must fail validation. Six families now include form.created.data.form and form.cancelled.data; replies support cancel and immediate interrupt, freeze negative fixture expectations independently.\",\n4455:      \"Code default=false + git runtime JSON absent ->run for all378baseline (REQ003/AC004). Runtime boolean true/env1true + native MachO ->serve only after rollout H7/H3/H6; enabled shebang fake ->run without probes unless explicit test override.\",\n4457:      \"force serve+FakeServe shebang ->v2 SSE/JSON, stdinDEVNULL; fake legacy blocking stdin ->EOF/ready failure<=3s explicit no silent run\",\n4460:      \"Default ask_reject, env deny both frozen permission rules; unsupported policy/missing safe endpoints fail-closed, no automatic policy switching\",\n4469:      \"retry accepted after model reasoning: exactly one retry status, raw model bytes retained, no reasoning dedup\",\n4471:      \"split interrupted marker filtering and split UTF8 must preserve all ordinary model bytes\",\n4477:      \"Serve HTTP ready success + accepted prompt headers but zero session SSE ->first_event_timeout at20s from prompt_send_start +cleanup<=1.2 (<22s); first_event_ms remainsnull\",\n4480:      \"Valid started/control but no useful model token ->first_token_timeout60s; started/control/comments/reject not token, no indefinite reset\",\n4481:      \"After first useful model delta pause>stall60 ->stall_timeout; comments/bridge statuses/repeated transport noise do not reset\",\n4493:      \"VER-005 GroupB inject parent SIGKILL (1) immediately after helper Popen before helper entry/lease, (2) immediately after serve Popen before serve_pid publication, (3) after atomic lease before handshake, (4) after handshake before lsof/READY, (5) during prompt. Same helper→serve group; EOF never lost, helper watcher active before READY. Include TERM-ignoring descendant and terminal_quiescence order (all writers stopped ->owned root removal ->lease unlink ->final same-group KILL; no imagined helper finally after self-KILL). Assert listener_pid==serve_pid and pgid==child_pgid,0 owned helper/serve/descendants/lease/temp roots,0 foreign signals/deletions including PID/PGID reuse. Separately kill/disable helper, restart bridge with retained lease ->safe startup reaper; this is recovery scenario, not immediate EOF success.50 normal cancellation cycles return all counters/FD/thread/pipe counts to0; lifeline_w closed every exit. Stage3/H0/H9 remain NOT_RUN.\",\n4494:      \"Entire normal Keep-Alive path(permission/form/reply/interrupt/DELETE),including50controls:exactly1 lsof/successful spawn and1retained control TCP. Separate explicit control-socket reconnect scenario permits only2nd lsof<=0.35s outside reply0.25s/cleanupAPI0.20s; spies distinguish the scenarios; urgent control disconnect is fail-closed,never lsof wait.3forced lsof timeouts ->3ServeHealth failures->DEGRADED,nextauto has0serve/helper/lsof Popen. Check listener_pid==serve_pid and pgid==helper_proc.pid; count lifeline2ends during setup/one parent end thereafter,all0afterfinally; parentFD<=128,allprocess344design,55admittedthreads,19systemprocesspeak; probes1/slot. H3 measures actual RSS/FD/thread/ports and rejects excess without raising limits.\"\n4497:      \"every split point and single-char deltas for both tags, JSON embedded close strings/code quoting existing fixtures\",\n4500:      \"native call lifecycle normalized/dedup per call-id, mapped/unmapped behavior identical; no auto allow\",\n4504:      \"permission.asked {data.id,sessionID,action,resources,source} ->POST reply {decision:reject},status204; both ask_reject/deny modes; POST prompt may stayblocked while reject executes on separate control socket; never once/always/allow.\",\n4505:      \"Frozen wire tokens.cache.read/write ->canonical tokens{input,output,cached=cache.read,reasoning}; mutate delta path/cache envelope/permission lifecycle ->independent oracle fail, step assistantMessageID dedup, not invented wire stepID.\",\n4506:      \"Actual input.started(name), input.delta, input.ended(text), called(input,executed), progress(metadata), success/failed. Correlate data.sessionID+assistantMessageID+id; accumulate tool name/input, normalize tool_use part{tool,state{input,status}}+call_id. permission.asked отправляет decision=reject немедленно по отдельному control lane. Никакого встроенного allow или выполнения bridge-side. On input.ended save $.data.text and parse JSON as object with runtime validation. Prefer called.data.input if present and valid; if called absent before failed/step.ended use completed input.ended.text, including streaming→failed. Never emit partial JSON; dedup by sessionID/assistantMessageID/call id. Both paths give identical mapped DSH tool_calls. Invalid JSON follows existing incomplete/unmapped recovery, not invented empty args.\",\n4508:      \"permission reject and form cancel MUST immediately interrupt; Step2 output0 even if emitted concurrently, completed input.ended JSON tool mapping same as called.input. Cancel/reject failure fail-closed.\",\n4515:      \"AC-026 / VER-005 / Clean-Room L2: tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py создаёт tmp_path / \\\"dynamic_config.json\\\" с {\\\"REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED\\\":true}; monkeypatch.setattr(server, \\\"DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH\\\", cfg_path, raising=False). При переносе только этого testfile на непропатченный origin/dev нет AttributeError: реально POST /v1/chat/completions, RED именно на поведенческих realtime chunk intervals (чтение socket до upstream release), GREEN на новом коде. Та же Server instance: атомарно false в cfg_path ->следующий запрос run без restart; true ->serve при test eligibility override/native, deletion/invalid JSON/nonbool/unreadable ->false; unchanged (st_mtime_ns,st_size) ->нет reopen. Новый cfg stat key для переключения обеспечивается и проверяется тестом, без sleep-предположений. Existing378 tests не создают JSON и остаются run. Runtime результаты NOT_RUN.\"\n4522:      \"wire event JSON decode allowed; config decode/re.compile/reparse-full-history on per-delta hot path forbidden\",\n4527:      \"Admitted parent55=1+18+6+6+6+12+6; steadyFD108+transient6lifeline_r=114<=128;19process peak includes6helper+6serve+6lsof/ps probes (one/slot),RSS per-slot~200.8<=216/full1552<=1638.4MiB design. lifeline_w finally closed,live H3 must measure rejection/transient and loaded RSS.\",\n4528:      \"All phase×event actions and two health counter effects match fallback_decision_table; changedmtime+same used-schema projection->serve, mismatch->run+diagnostic;permission capability gap fail-closed.\",\n4530:      \"first_token_timeout proven non-security protocol/capability defect ->ServeHealth+1,UpstreamBreaker0; valid protocol/model silence ->ServeHealth0,UpstreamBreaker+1; exactly one increment once/cause; unchanged delivery barrier/cap3.\"\n4532:    \"rollout_boundary\": \"Все H0..H9 NOT_RUN, external a6/panel/arch/r15 ACCEPT+panel proof и независимые VER gates обязательны; Architect не выполняет rollout. H0 BLOCKING до sync/restart: проверить текущий env не force serve/true, отсутствие production dynamic_config.json либо boolean false; при прежнем enabled состоянии атомарно записать false, проверить read-back; дополнительный disable-serve разрешён. Снять старые PID/start/lease identity. H4 sync/read-back server.py hash; H5 launchctl kickstart с config absent/false: сразу dark run без окна serve; startup reaper0 старых собственных serve/helper/temp roots, чужие процессы untouched. На отдельном кандидате test-local dynamic_config.json=true и отдельный disable-file path: provider-free info/active, H3 реальные6parallel RSS/FD+OPENCODE_DB=:memory:, H6 live permission/tool isolation, Stage3a/A затем3b/B. На production до H7 run. H7 ТОЛЬКО после PASS H3 и H6: при env auto без explicit false и закрытом TTL подготовить tempfile в ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/,0600, записать {\\\"REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED\\\":true}, os.replace в dynamic_config.json; убедиться дополнительный disable-serve отсутствует. Следующий native auto запрос на :9883 использует serve без правки start.sh и без повторного рестарта LaunchAgent. H8 повторяет живые проверки рабочего чата, H9 проверяет runtime false/true и disable-file same PID, отдельно kickstart-k crash recovery. Никакой выдачи design/NOT_RUN за runtime PASS. H4 uses ONLY cp bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py, then SHA-256 read-back. Never rsync --delete or directory sync. Preserve live dynamic_config.json and disable-serve byte-for-byte (or their recorded absence) from H0 snapshot AFTER any intentional H0 false-write; H0/H4 read back existence/bytes/mode after cp. H5 restarts only after that preservation check; no copy/delete/overwrite of either runtime file. Default=false and true only H7 after H3/H6, no new owner waiver required.\"\n4544:    \"rework_coverage\": \"a4 exactly4RW+6FU=10 entries; findings PANEL-A4-F-001..011,006 duplicate absorbedRW003. Valid JSON Pointers include both THREAT-001/002. a1/a2/a3 histories retained exact JSON values; alias current a4 only.\",\n4582:      \"resolution\": \"Историческое a1 требование default=true superseded compliant delta cycle3b: кодовый default=false, runtime JSON absent/false до H7. Активация :9883 атомарным true после H3/H6 без start.sh/restart;378legacy идут run. Источник a1 сохраняется как история, без human waiver.\"\n4601:        \"Brief logical session.permission.requested/tokens.cached\",\n4602:        \"EVD-062 actual v2.1.2 permission.asked/tokens.cache.read+write; permission reply decision\"\n4617:    \"namespace\": \"Current alias mirrors rework_resolutions_a5; a1..a4 JSON values remain exactly preserved. Analyst ledger F-01..F-49 only; new findings PANEL-A5-F-NNN.\",\n4632:        