\"\n5105:      \"changes_made\": \"Owner proof errors counted once,3timeouts→DEGRADED; --port0 stdout considered unverified alternative; one bounded lsof/helper resource accounting included.\",\n5110:        \"#/resilience_gates/C_MULT/C-MULT-I5\"\n5161:        \"#/resilience_gates/R_BULK/R-BULK-I3\"\n5174:      \"changes_made\": \"REQ004/005 match thinking eligibility/grace.30,fast/off/JSON exclusions and immutable model bytes; mandatory post-token stall heartbeat threshold/interval15s, no watchdog resets.\",\n5193:      \"changes_made\": \"18admittedhandlers+readers/delivery/12drains/supervisors/watchdogs→55parentthreads;108FD<=128,helper/lsof process/memory included; normalp99goal180 vs degraded3*60+51.6=231.6 separately measured, flood caveat explicit.\",\n5212:      \"changes_made\": \"Кодовый дефолт REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED=false. Локальный runtime dynamic_config.json — stdlib-аналог dynamic_config.py/GigaRC автономного моста без внешних зависимостей: H0 отсутствие файла или boolean false удерживает run; H7 атомарно включает true только после успешных H3 (6 параллельных слотов RSS/FD с OPENCODE_DB=\\\":memory:\\\") и H6 (живая permission/tool изоляция на кандидате). Без исключений из канона, human waiver, новых env-переменных и правок start.sh; никакой записи dynamic_config.json в git. AC-004:378legacy run при отсутствии файла. AC-026/VER-005 Clean-Room L2: tmp_path JSON true и monkeypatch.setattr(server,\\\"DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH\\\",cfg_path,raising=False), RED на chunk timing против origin/dev, GREEN на новом; false runtime без restart.\",\n5281:      \"changes_made\": \"Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease. Mandatory clean-room GroupB oracle: empty temporary HOME with no ~/.opencode/bin/opencode; monkeypatch.setattr(server, \\\"OPENCODE_BIN\\\", str(fake_serve_bin)); actual parent -> helper_proc -> fake_serve_bin, not in-process mock. Parent uses subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); helper uses subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). Prove child executable and all serve arguments exactly equal passed fake, same owned child_pgid, zero OPENCODE_BIN in serve_env, no broader whitelist. Spy/audit helper I/O plus early-exit structural assertions prove zero state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json accesses and no sqlite3/http.client/http.server/zen_catalog loaded; reload_catalog/_DEFAULT_RESILIENCE and server globals absent. Reject every invalid six-argument length/value before spawn. Retain EOF/TERM/lease/reaper/listener proof fault oracles: this test does not replace them. Actual Stage3 test NOT_RUN; EVD-079 local minimal chain observed.\",\n5363:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n5383:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n5394:      \"changes_made\": \"One parent->helper->serve tree, helper session leader/serve same group, lifeline armed before spawn, lease before handshake before lsof/READY. helper_proc poll,listener_pid==serve_pid,killpg child_pgid everywhere. Explicit self-KILL terminal quiescence avoids post-KILL finally fiction.55threads,114parentFD<=128,19processes,per-slot RSS~176.8<=192MiB/full1408<=1638.4 design,live H3 NOT_RUN.\",\n5402:        \"/resilience_gates/C_MULT/C-MULT-I5\",\n5407:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n5426:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n5443:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n5454:      \"changes_made\": \"Separate first_token_timeout protocol/capability and model-silence rows,mutually exclusive ServeHealth1/Upstream0 vs0/1; no delivery/retry weakening.\",\n5460:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n5475:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n5486:      \"changes_made\": \"Normal whole Keep-Alive path exactly1lsof/spawn; second proof only separate explicit control reconnect<=0.35s outside fast budgets;spies distinguish;urgent brokencontrol failclosed.\",\n5489:        \"/resilience_gates/C_MULT/C-MULT-I5/oracle\",\n5492:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n5503:      \"changes_made\": \"H4 cp ONLY server.py,never rsync--delete/directory sync;preserve dynamic_config.json and disable-serve bytes/absence/mode;H0/H4 readback,H5 after;H7 true only after H3/H6.\",\n5510:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n5555:      \"changes_made\": \"Родитель резервирует 127.0.0.1:0 и запускает только helper_proc с argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), ...], start_new_session=True; child_pgid=helper_proc.pid. Helper устанавливает EOF/TERM надзор до spawn, атомарно публикует lease и запускает serve_proc с start_new_session=False в той же группе child_pgid; публикует serve_pid/serve_lstart до handshake/READY. --serve-helper <attempt_id> находится в первых аргументах ps -ww argv. До отправки любых Authorization/пароля или prompt обязательны одновременно listener_pid == serve_pid, os.getpgid(listener_pid) == child_pgid и helper_proc.poll() is None; ровно один lsof с бюджетом <=0.35s внутри общего ready<=3.0s. На mismatch/timeout/неоднозначность 0 байт Authorization/пароля/prompt, fail-closed, retry только внутри исходного ready/cap3 после cleanup. Cleanup os.killpg(child_pgid, SIGTERM→SIGKILL) охватывает подтверждённые собственные helper + serve + потомков, с lifeline/reap/root+lease cleanup по crash_recovery; чужой PID в той же или иной группе получает 0 байт пароля и 0 сигналов чужому PGID. Секреты только sanitized env, без argv/lease/log; no redirects/proxy. Normal Keep-Alive control path не вызывает повторный lsof; отдельный explicit reconnect имеет собственный proof, как listener_ownership.\",\n5563:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n5581:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n5600:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n5620:      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",